WEBVTT

00:00:00.406 --> 00:00:07.859
In this video, you will add photos to a home you added yourself, and send the homeowner a private link, so they can add their own.

00:00:07.859 --> 00:00:08.865
We start on the map.

00:00:09.831 --> 00:00:11.505
Start at SoCal Lights dot app.

00:00:14.317 --> 00:00:16.867
On the home page, tap Use my location.

00:00:18.535 --> 00:00:19.515
Then tap Allow.

00:00:22.543 --> 00:00:25.750
Now look at the top of the map, beside the search box.

00:00:25.750 --> 00:00:28.533
See your picture, or your initial, in a circle?

00:00:28.533 --> 00:00:33.096
That is your account menu, and it is the doorway to everything else on the site.

00:00:33.096 --> 00:00:33.797
Tap it.

00:00:35.361 --> 00:00:37.320
In the menu, tap Your contests.

00:00:38.876 --> 00:00:42.966
That is where the contests you run, and the homes you entered, live.

00:00:42.966 --> 00:00:44.848
Tap Mine, your personal page.

00:00:46.398 --> 00:00:48.506
Tap Manage, next to your contest.

00:00:50.308 --> 00:00:51.502
Now tap Entries.

00:00:53.247 --> 00:00:58.535
Each home you added shows two buttons for the homeowner: Copy link, and Email link.

00:00:58.535 --> 00:01:00.607
The link is private to that home.

00:01:00.607 --> 00:01:04.027
The homeowner signs in with it, and links the home to their account.

00:01:04.879 --> 00:01:09.623
Email link opens an email with the link and a short message already written.

00:01:09.623 --> 00:01:11.804
Add the homeowner's address, and send it.

00:01:12.568 --> 00:01:14.783
To add a photo yourself, tap Photos.

00:01:16.503 --> 00:01:19.854
Add up to eight photos, from your phone or your computer.

00:01:19.854 --> 00:01:22.423
They are made smaller for you, so they load fast.

00:01:23.262 --> 00:01:27.918
The photo shows right away, on the contest page, the ballot and the map.

00:01:27.918 --> 00:01:31.263
As the organizer, you can remove any photo, with the cross.

00:01:32.115 --> 00:01:34.783
Below the photos is the homeowner's link.

00:01:34.783 --> 00:01:39.896
If you sent it to the wrong person, tap Make a new link, and the old one stops working.

00:01:39.896 --> 00:01:45.363
Once the homeowner links the home, you can unlink them, and send a new link to someone else.

00:01:45.363 --> 00:01:48.840
Photos can be added and removed until voting closes.

00:01:48.840 --> 00:01:50.539
After that, they are locked.

00:01:51.391 --> 00:01:54.787
That is how you add photos, and invite the homeowner.

00:01:54.787 --> 00:01:57.311
Photos stay open until voting closes.

00:01:58.671 --> 00:02:01.436
Next up: Add photos and details to your home.
